# IDE
# Cursorの設定フォルダ全体は基本除外。ただしProject Rules（.cursor/rules）は共有したいので例外扱いにする。
.cursor/*
!.cursor/rules/
!.cursor/rules/**
!.cursor/skills/
!.cursor/skills/**
*.code-workspace

# Local 1Password references.
auth/*.local.json

# Public snapshot: generated native dependencies must remain redistributable.
!patches/isar_flutter_libs/**/*.so
!patches/isar_flutter_libs/**/*.dylib
!patches/isar_flutter_libs/**/*.dll
